    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eacf070466bc6b42f334b2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要绕完整座学园，实在相当辛苦。\n想到她一直在无人知晓的地方坚持做着这些，\n我再次感到佩服。将这份心情告诉她后……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aeb3f9590dd649d18764383b6596a24d2309ff6f2349cf73e070fa982863685",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
