    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a074f8057f7626d4b1fac298",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是因为和训练员在一起吗？\n呵呵呵――我很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4754a656cb4aca4e2ae861de7a5fe2cb2b9d538efe1538ded4606eb765b39468",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:884a972d27bdc67ad1db59e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以的话，能让我帮忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdddc07750bf0bf0fb37c3106f5ce3cc892d107aa107c6d23615476bd24b3c9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:510dcf557b2ff5c35560ae08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然已经见怪不怪了，还是忍不住感到佩服。\n照料花朵，具体来说\n都要做些什么呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c561b6e3d18cd7565a2652e64e6d13cc393d6fca3b7710e4028271ccdcd1ec93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09607c170fd68dd6ec05c669",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她像春风一般微笑着。\n那一天，每当我在校内看见花瓶时，\n心中都会变得暖洋洋的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e91d117966adb4161861b628e3a30063fc57c1e5ad219d0e83522c25f9052a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:332d5d3df307cd7149ec3453",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在阳光照耀之下，\n我和机伶金花一起，\n给宽阔的田地浇了许多水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00efb73ace7e53e0df6744116683abd6b0a521301759ce6ab2f042e563977336",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7733fd4d53800d938570a52d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇，竟然这么多……这看起来很辛苦啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "1980eb2e631cecdaacaaf53d43eba60444bc8fe401487092b8a8f5103f9d245e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
