    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cb48c7e5c52639f88abd5cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼――今天也很热呢。\n差不多也该除草了……\n天气一热，杂草很快就会长起来……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07a69dff25765127c2da2bc12855879da3d4d1ea678e13ea9e7b7e5f4973b780",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
