      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，这怎么好――您明明这么忙，太麻烦您了。\n要配合我的时间，也很不容易。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb7444717322a26244ac4c3d8dbab9985a8d6c8f3a55fd2804c5abab6fabbc96",
