    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acd1d62afe33da041f443b60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，您这样……真的可以吗？\n承蒙您费心，实在惶恐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab1798d7b47a5d58f5fcfea03d778d53ede924867a5763c1821fc06ea742ed2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
