    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5613b0cab314817aeb90bc3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟之前曾被她婉拒过一次，\n我有些尴尬。然而她仿佛接受了一切般，\n这样说道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77e1ffc181627e12a7f039cadaa318082ded439d34b7a07717f3435cdc395c0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
