    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed97a954d8816572519e94a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个…………。\n向日葵，正开得很漂亮。\n要不要一起去纳个凉？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93164b9c764b654aaebeacbd308b1e34deec91aaedbbce42a265b56f73921cb3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
