    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6e7a774c7485795d052f874",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来到田地后，机伶金花\n静静地注视着种在花盆里的苗木。\n上面结着许多花苞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e97ab8e43efd9302055de1a64c26f492ef2cfd9a696b6c405576bb6d0ece7212",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
