    {
      "uid": "zhcn:524e9831bcd9cebf6d7f645c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac61622ca381c2283408cff4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。等它开花之后，\n我想把它和其他花盆一起摆出来装饰……\n所以一直很用心地照料着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d3afa057366987724e11f2a8c8aef54cf60d740435b25946865f5ff90ba77be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2196e0359e7ec64fd0a3c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花说得十分开心。\n然而，她忽然低声说道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1b50fad5af4a259c8deee2a45ad298c5eee271712e2676394b12096b0f0bf71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50e49101c9b3f27bc611e6fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb6641123f864231678e5412",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――秋玫瑰，\n会在夏天修剪花苞，\n让它积蓄力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f62a3e69b438d3408e7938f3a3b427fa1e5aa02c35c373b0535f87810064bca0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751913f83808892e507e2f89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e6df7d5f42a772842391f48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样一来，到了秋天就会开出漂亮的花……。\n我也希望自己，能变成那样――\n我是这么想的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8c4e73e5750cd0ca42473511e01fe6cbe2a1e6aa81e6f9c5a0e7b0a5757b108",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96c4eab5f63a432761dc2b82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你一定能做到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7d99fa1be76cc751d57c28d4246f7b35e516da9bab7618b56fd489fe20a222",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32148edfc81df7845609df01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得，这仿佛就像赛马娘一样。\n机伶金花在这个夏天，\n也非常努力。所以……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a105acf8b8749d704ef3211928b27ef4c0ee97ee81c41fec4b66f626edd0767f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
